<div id="coaching">
  <section class="intro">
    <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-center justify-content-md-between align-items-md-end w-100">
      <%= image_tag "coaching-title.svg", alt: "self awareness, self empowerement", class: "coaching-title" %>
      <%= image_tag "yoga.png", alt: "yoga", class: "yoga-img" %>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="health-coaching">
    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-column w-100">
      <%= image_tag "sparkles.svg", alt: "sparkles", class: "sparkles" %>
      <h2>What is</h2>
      <h2>Health Coaching?</h2>
      <button data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#bookModal">BOOK A CALL WITH ME</button>
      <div class="modal fade" id="bookModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="bookModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog">
          <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
              <h1 class="modal-title fs-5 mb-0" id="bookModalLabel">Book a call with me</h1>
              <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
              ...
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Save changes</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="self-empowerement-section">
    <div class="row m-0 h-100">
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 m-0 p-0">
        <div class="tree-container position-relative">
          <%= image_tag "tree-and-blobs.svg", alt: "tree", class: "tree-img" %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 m-0 p-0">
        <div class="text-container d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center">
          <div id="carousel-indicators" class="carousel carousel-dark slide" data-bs-ride="carousel">
            <div class="carousel-indicators">
              <button type="button" data-bs-target="#carousel-indicators" data-bs-slide-to="0" class="active" aria-current="true" aria-label="Slide 1"></button>
              <button type="button" data-bs-target="#carousel-indicators" data-bs-slide-to="1" aria-label="Slide 2"></button>
              <button type="button" data-bs-target="#carousel-indicators" data-bs-slide-to="2" aria-label="Slide 3"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="carousel-inner">
              <div class="carousel-item active">
                <div class="carousel-item-inner">
                  <p class="mb-0">I am eager to share what I’ve learned to help</p>
                  <p><strong>empower you on your journey. </strong></p>
                  <p>As a Holistic Health Coach, my goal is to help you become your best self by achieving a balanced lifestyle through habits and choices. I do this by raising awareness about how your mind and body can cooperate to create a healthy body and a thriving internal life.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="carousel-item">
                <div class="carousel-item-inner">
                  <p>My personal experience with mindful living, as well as the course I completed at the Institute of Integrative Nutrition, have given me the tools required to help you help yourself! </p>
                  <p>I offer strengths-based support and guide you towards making connections, identifying patterns, shifting limiting beliefs and using a growth mind-set. </p>
                  <br>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="carousel-item">
                <div class="carousel-item-inner">
                  <p class="mb-0">In a series of conversations, I learn what makes my client tick:</p>
                  <p>your habits, needs, and aims. In addition to supporting you with specifc goals, I provide the space for you to choose health-promoting behaviors tailored to you. Together, we establish a solid blueprint for organic transformation through long-term behavior changes.</p>
                  <p>It brings me such joy to see my clients become kinder to themselves and approach their health with openness and curiosity.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#carousel-indicators" data-bs-slide="prev">
              <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="visually-hidden">Previous</span>
            </button>
            <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#carousel-indicators" data-bs-slide="next">
              <span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="visually-hidden">Next</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="testimonials">
    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-column h-100">
      <%= image_tag "sparkles.svg", alt: "sparkles", class: "sparkles" %>
      <h2 class="testimonial-text mb-0">Are you ready to</h2>
      <h2 class="testimonial-text last">be an expert on yourself?</h2>
      <p>Don’t take my word for it - here’s what they have to say:</p>
      <%= link_to "testimonials", testimonials_path %>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="featured-testimonials mb-3 position-relative">
    <div class="pen-wrapper">
      <%= image_tag "pen.svg", alt: "pen", class: "pen" %>
    </div>
    <div class="row m-0">
      <% @testimonials.each_with_index do |testimonial, index| %>
        <div class="col-12 col-md-6 p-0">
          <div class="testimonial" style="background-color: <%= @colors[index] %>">
            <%= image_tag "testimonial-img.svg", alt: "testimonial" %>
            <h3><%= testimonial.name %></h3>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
